    "body": "Another thing that might not be worth mentioning, but is still in the context of, is that if you call `pushState` too often [it throws](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/History/pushState#exceptions). Blink [doesn't seem to throw](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/core/frame/history.cc;l=377;drc=e65323be17a0ba06198d18b0a8bf5ae594e10348?q=history::pushstate) but could, and Gecko already [does that](https://searchfox.org/mozilla-central/rev/058836008f131ae5591d04952a1500c9f94bedbc/dom/base/nsHistory.cpp#185). Gecko also does this for `location.{href, hash, ...}`, but that's not specced as far as I can tell, but probably should be for the same reason.",
